{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"870","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A. Search for Pretty Integers"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given two lists of non-zero digits."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Let's call an integer pretty if its (base "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"10"},{"kind":"text","text":") representation has at least one digit from the first list and at least one digit from the second list. What is the smallest positive pretty integer?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains two integers "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ n, m ≤ 9"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the lengths of the first and the second lists, respectively."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"n"},{"kind":"text","text":" distinct digits "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"a1, a2, ..., an"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ ai ≤ 9"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the elements of the first list."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line contains "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"m"},{"kind":"text","text":" distinct digits "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"b1, b2, ..., bm"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1 ≤ bi ≤ 9"},{"kind":"text","text":") — the elements of the second list."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print the smallest pretty integer."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"2 3\n4 2\n5 7 6\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"25\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"8 8\n1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8\n8 7 6 5 4 3 2 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"1\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"25"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"46"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"24567"},{"kind":"text","text":" are pretty, as well as many other integers. The smallest among them is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"25"},{"kind":"text","text":". "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"42"},{"kind":"text","text":" and "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"24"},{"kind":"text","text":" are not pretty because they don't have digits from the second list."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example all integers that have at least one digit different from "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"9"},{"kind":"text","text":" are pretty. It's obvious that the smallest among them is "},{"kind":"math_inline","text":"1"},{"kind":"text","text":", because it's the smallest positive integer."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"A","problemCode":"870A","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/870/problem/A"}